  "details": "So for more context, I noticed when I was on blue status and I hid my hud, people requesting invites were no longer being automatically accepted. VrChat was acting like I was on green or red status and had the invite requests waiting in my quick menu still. Don't know if it makes a difference, but I also had nameplates off.\nEdit: forgot to add I was in a friend's invite+ instance and manually accepting the invites did nothing.",
